  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When the three peak stage Gu Masters on San Cha mountain bring out rank five Gu, Tie Mu Bai’s turn gold Gu flies everywhere. Rocks, grasses, trees, flowers, birds, fishes, or beasts that it shoots through turn into golden sculpture, their life force extinguished.",
        "chapters": [
          373
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_tie_mu_bai"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Tie Mu Bai’s purple crystal primeval sea it appears as a golden small hand flying like a golden light. It is his vital Gu and strongest long range attack method; any lifeform hit turns into pure gold and loses its life. Even Ku Mo and Wu Gui do not dare take the attack head on. Fang Yuan excavates it with Tie Mu Bai’s other Gu and keeps it; a hit from it would leave him no way to survive.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "vital-gu-and-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "char_ku_mo",
          "char_wu_gui",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against a swamp crab desolate beast, Fang Yuan still holds turn gold Gu among other rank five Gu such as Soft Bones Gu and Pitch Black Gu, yet using them would be like throwing pebbles in a lake and would only create slight ripples without continuous attack.",
        "chapters": [
          417
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "holdings-against-swamp-crab",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_soft_bones_gu",
          "gu_pitch_black_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He leaves turn gold Gu in Hu Immortal blessed land with other Gu he cannot use at the time, including Vajra Stare Gu, Pitch Black Gu, blood skull Gu, Bone Flesh Unity Gu, and Yin Yang Rotation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "left-in-hu-immortal-blessed-land",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
